{"id": "02", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "TY", "text": "[cheerful, storyteller] Hi. I'm Ty. I'm twelve. And I am the cheapest person you will ever meet."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "I have never spent a single Robux. Not on a hat. Not on a pet. Not even on a game pass."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[proud, deadpan] My avatar still wears the free starter shirt. [pause] It's not a look. It's a lifestyle."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "I eat the free samples at the supermarket for lunch. I reuse birthday wrapping paper. I once returned a gift... to my own grandma."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[whispers, secretive] Because I had a plan. [pause] The AFK farm."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "In second grade, I taped down my spacebar in a clicker game... [pause] and I never turned it off."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[amazed] Four years later, my computer is basically a space heater. [pause] And my balance is... three MILLION Robux."}, {"speaker": "MIA", "text": "[sarcastic, bored] Wow. Three million pixels. Can you buy groceries with pixels?"}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "That's my sister, Mia. She spent every Robux she ever had on hats."}, {"speaker": "MIA", "text": "[offended] Four hundred and twelve hats. It's called FASHION."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "And this is my best friend, Pickle."}, {"speaker": "TY", "text": "[aside] He lives next door. He has never once used a door."}, {"speaker": "PICKLE", "text": "[goofy, proud] I have twelve Robux! [pause] I'm saving up for a shoe."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 6.16, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 96, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 6.16, "end_time_seconds": 12.64, "character_start_index": 96, "character_end_index": 183, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o", "start_time_seconds": 12.64, "end_time_seconds": 18.720000000000002, "cha